"P1284143769" "You did it. Superb work.<br><br>You know, this reminds me of when... Wait a second.<br><br><color orange>Dr. Steffard examines Seer 0293's cybernetics for a moment and then his eyes widen.</color><br><br>Quickly, I need to get her inside..."

