"P2822768674" "Why'd Steffard drag you along, Power Puff? 'Fraid something might happen?"
// Answer Text :
"P1805693171" "Let's just say I'm insurance."
// Page InformationPage1 Text :
"P487092773" "Don't worry, nothing's gonna... Wait. Did you hear something?"
// Answer Text :
