// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P925155348" "These cybernetics in this woman's head... They're unlike any Seer implants I've seen before. Fascinating.<br><br>Amazing, it's as if they quadrupled the number of pathways... That would likely extend the range, but the signal would be so weak you could only pick it up with a receiver of some kind. Maybe it's..."
// AcceptString :
"P76236160" "Can I help you further?"
// SendOffString :
"P947775685" "Ah! I apologize, {HeroName}, I get so entranced with my work, I sometimes lose focus on anything but it.<br><br>Yes, I really could use your help. I want to find out more about these implants, but the only person I've dealt with in the past on such issues, at least, with any degree of success, was a rather, shall we say, <i>understanding</i> member of the Syndicate.<br><br>Things are very dicey right now with the Syndicate. <color orange>I want you to escort me while I meet with Maxine.</color> I don't expect any trouble from her, it's the rest of the Syndicate that worries me."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1374862578" "Meet with the Syndicate"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2285636851" "Whenever you're ready, but please, let's not keep Maxine waiting.<br><br>I made her wait once and she told me a story about..."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P4132355230" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two: A Second Opinion</color>"

