// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2263362302" "You fought off a horde of ghouls that came out of nowhere and Dr. Steffard got the information he needed from Maxine."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1614277162" "Horrifying!<br><br>The Seer implant that I removed from Seer 0293 appears to emit some sort of tracking signal... one that the Ghouls are inclined to listen for.<br><br>Maxine informed me that some of her brethren in the Syndicate have started hearing reports about increased Ghoul activity over in Neutropolis, and the Crusaders have been talking about more and more coordinated Ghoul attacks on their positions as well. I have a theory that these events are somehow linked, but I do not yet know how."
// RandomFameString :
"P1667163175" "I hear that the PPD are close to putting an end to those Ghouls down in the tunnels."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1837258520" "The implant I dug out of Seer 0293 has four times the number of synaptic accelerator pathways, greatly extending the range of her telepathy, but making it so weak that even another psychic would have trouble picking it up in the same room. <color orange>I have a theory in the works, but I need you to help me find some evidence to back it up.</color>"
// AcceptString :
"P622148251" "Help Steffard prove his theory."
// SendOffString :
"P4290577948" "At first I dismissed the design as flawed, but I'm starting to see a very real brilliance behind this device, {HeroName}.<br><br>The range is extended, that is key. This device attached to a class 11 Seer, like our friend 0293, has a range roughly about that of Imperial City, a stronger Seer could easily cover Praetoria City.<br><br>But here's the key that threw me off. The range is increased, but at the expense of power. With this installed, Seer 0293 couldn't read the mind of a fly, nor could she transmit a thought with any clarity beyond a foot. The device simply saps too much strength out of the psychic signal to do anything but travel distance. So why was she so powerful when you found her in that office building?<br><br><color orange>The answer to that, my friend, I hope you will find in M.I.C.I.R.'s Seer Facility over in Industry Avenue.</color> According to Maxine, they're working on something she claims to be very similar to the device I showed her.<br><br>While you do that I'll do some tests with these Ghoul collars. I have a feeling that whoever is putting the Ghouls in these restraints has something to do with these Seer implants as well."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1963121093" "Search Seer Facility in M.I.C.I.R."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1272531507" "Get access to the database inside that facility and look for anything pertaining to <color yellow>synaptic accelerator pathways</i>. If they're working on what I think they are, that will get you a lot of hits on your query."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P264445947" "<color deepskyblue>Part Three: Just Because You Can...</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P186779998" "Facilities like these are where the Seers go for psychic downloads and regeneration."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2740664963" "O'Connell"
// Script Variable BOSS_1_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P878248526" "The latest test went horribly wrong. We've got two dead researchers and seventeen injured."
// Script Variable BOSS_1_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2128892725" "Excuse me. This is a restricted area!"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1257959761" "Martins"
// Script Variable BOSS_2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1252166079" "<em t=3>The injured can be wiped, it's the deaths that will cause the most trouble."
// Script Variable BOSS_2_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3223884837" "We have a level 3 security violation here in research!"
// Script Variable BOSS_3_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2549969038" "Tracker"
