// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - Marchand 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page Intro Text :
"P3207755069" "Is this line secure?"
// Answer Text :
"P1414048075" "Yes"
// Page Page1 Text :
"P350929146" "Good.<br><br>What's your status? I assume you have something to report."
// Answer Text :
"P4039134567" "Dr. Steffard has discovered the Seer implants to control Ghouls."
// Page Page2 Text :
"P1042101474" "I can neither confirm, nor deny the existence or knowledge of what you just said.<br><br>What does he plan to do?"
// Answer Text :
"P494274845" "He wants to destroy the research data."
// Page Page3 Text :
"P2479521306" "Destroy the data?<br><br>You mean take a copy of it to the Resistance and then destroy the data, yes?"
// Answer Text :
"P92608591" "No, he believes that any group using it is unacceptable."
// Page Page4 Text :
"P1810550434" "Interesting.<br><br>I want you to do exactly as I say, {HeroName}. <color orange>Make a copy of the plans, then destroy them as Steffard instructed.</color>"
// Answer Text :
"P768530963" "What am I to do with the copies?"
// Page Page5 Text :
"P3091596364" "Bring the copies to me for <i>safe keeping</i>. Do not entrust them to anyone else, it could jeopardize your identity."
// Answer Text :
"P1169881993" "Yes sir."

