// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1188223900" "{HeroName}, I've had to make a lot of very difficult moral choices in my time as a physician and scientist. I've had to weigh the life of one patient against another, question the implications of my research more times than I can remember, and even struggle with the bliss a lie can give, versus the dread the truth can cause.<br><br>But this... this is a crossroads for me. On the one hand we have here the chance to give the Resistance control of the Ghouls, turn them against Cole's forces and gain the edge we need in this ideological war. But to do so would invalidate everything we are fighting for. We don't even know for sure who the Ghouls are, or where they came from. To use them as our enemies would is both immoral and unthinkable."
// AcceptString :
"P1411922576" "Ask Steffard what he wants to do."
// SendOffString :
"P4161347578" "There is no choice to be made. The data needs to be destroyed. If I take it, no matter what good I might be able to do with it, I would eventually feel pressured to use it as intended, a weapon.<br><br><color orange>I want you to go back to M.I.C.I.R. and delete the data and any Seers that may be equipped with devices similar to the one implanted in Seer 0293.</color><br><br>Speaking of which, <i>Rebecca</i> is awake and doing well. She asked me to thank you for freeing her from the network. It will be some time before she is herself again. In the meantime I'm going to try and find her family.<br><br><color yellow>Those Loyalists who are <i>truly</i> loyal to the safety and peace of Praetoria would do well to speak with Provost Marchand about events that are happening.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1294844647" "Raid M.I.C.I.R."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2767003272" "Remember, you'll need to delete the data not only from the main database, but any Seers possessing prototypes of the technology will have to be eliminated."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P10428265" "<color deepskyblue>Finale: ...Doesn't Mean You Should.</color>"

