// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P4045750293" "You destroyed the data from the M.I.C.I.R. database, ensuring that Seer controlled Ghouls won't be a reality, at least, not anytime soon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1930067688" "Ah, {HeroName}, you've returned successful I trust... That's good. That's very good...<br><br><color orange>You can tell something is disturbing the doctor immensely, so you inquire as to what's wrong.</color><br><br>Rebecca, Seer 0293, she's dead... They sent a kill signal to her. I... I couldn't save her. If only I'd removed all of the implants instead of researching that accursed Ghoul control implant, then she'd still be alive...<br><br>No. No! This is not my fault! I didn't pull the trigger, I didn't do anything but help that girl. Whoever is behind that wretched control technology is responsible, not me...<br><br>From now on, {HeroName}, I'm going to do whatever it takes to make sure that the Seers are in control of their own lives. Nobody will ever choose when they live or die but themselves."

